OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fdry with largely clear skies
OL,7,Fdeveloping this evening. Remaining dry
OL,8,Fand largely clear overnight leading to
OL,9,Fa cold and frosty night. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA mostly dry morning with
OL,12,Fsome bright and sunny spells. Cloudier
OL,13,Fin the afternoon with showers
OL,14,Fspreading southwards.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FMostly
OL,17,Fcloudy with showers on Friday, which
OL,18,Fmay be wintry. Dry with some long
OL,19,Fsunny spells on Saturday. Dry on
OL,20,FSunday. Cold with frosty nights.
